{"answer_text":"\"Free\" plans differ a lot in contact limits and locked features. The ones that stay useful without paying: [1]\n\n- **Northwind CRM**: Powerful and well supported, though per-seat costs climb quickly past the starter tier. [2]\n- **Pipewell Go**: Easy to adopt, but email features cost extra. [3]\n- **Orbitly**: A work-management app many small agencies bend into a lightweight CRM. [4]\n\nIn short, start with Northwind CRM if you want the quickest setup; shortlist Pipewell if you expect to need deeper reporting.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-510c-708f-884d-6a6e4d89fc25","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:29.450Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["free crm limits comparison","crm free plan no credit card"],"latency_ms":5580,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[116,129],[406,419]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[229,237],[462,470]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Orbitly","name_text":"Orbitly","offsets":[[298,305]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}],"model":"perplexity/sonar","prom